# Line endings: LF in the repository AND in every working tree, as in both tools.
#
# Without this, a clone on Windows (core.autocrlf=true, the Git for Windows
# default, including on GitHub's windows runners) converts text to CRLF on
# checkout. paritydoc/body.md is embedded with go:embed and compared byte for
# byte, notice text is compared byte for byte, and gofmt -l reports CRLF .go
# files as unformatted.
#
# text=auto still lets git detect binary content and leave it untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
